# Suru project file for the tests tree.
#
# Project discovery picks the NEAREST ancestor .suruproject, so this file governs
# both the test runner build (tests/runner/main.suru) and every fixture build
# under tests/fixtures/. It must therefore expose the compiler and stdlib source
# roots that fixtures import (Suru.Compiler.* / Suru.Stdlib.*), plus the unit-test
# tree (tests/unit/) whose namespaces the runner imports.
#
# Source root directories scanned for namespace declarations (relative to this file).
../src/compiler
../src/stdlib
unit
